<span class="font-headline font-bold text-lg text-on-surface">Industrial Series X</span>
<span class="bg-secondary-container text-on-secondary-container px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold tracking-wider">10,000L</span>
</div>
<p class="text-sm text-on-surface-variant font-medium">High-density polyethylene construction.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Abstract background shape -->
<div class="absolute right-0 top-0 w-1/2 h-full bg-surface-container-low -z-0 rounded-l-[100px] opacity-50 hidden lg:block transform translate-x-1/4"></div>
</section>
<!-- About Us Section -->
<section class="py-24 bg-surface-container-low transition-colors duration-500" id="about">
<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-8">
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-16">
<div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-6">
<h2 class="font-headline font-extrabold text-3xl md:text-4xl text-on-surface tracking-tight">Quienes Somos</h2>
<div class="w-16 h-1 bg-gradient-primary rounded-full mb-8"></div>
<p class="font-body text-base text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
                            At Rotonac, we transcend traditional manufacturing. We are architects of fluid containment. With over two decades of engineering expertise in rotational molding, we provide structural solutions that industries rely on for absolute safety and longevity.
                        </p>
<p class="font-body text-base text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
                            Our process ensures seamless, stress-free vessels capable of withstanding extreme environmental conditions, ensuring your resources are preserved with uncompromising integrity.
                        </p>
</div>
<div class="lg:col-span-7 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
<!-- Mission Card -->
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-3xl p-8 ambient-shadow inner-glow flex flex-col h-full hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform duration-300">
<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-2xl">target</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline font-bold text-xl text-on-surface mb-4">Mission</h3>
<p class="font-body text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mt-auto">
                                To engineer the most reliable, structurally sound fluid storage systems through innovative polymer technology and precision manufacturing processes.
                            </p>
</div>
<!-- Vision Card -->
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-3xl p-8 ambient-shadow inner-glow flex flex-col h-full hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform duration-300">
<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-secondary/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-2xl">visibility</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline font-bold text-xl text-on-surface mb-4">Vision</h3>
<p class="font-body text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mt-auto">
                                To set the global architectural standard for industrial and residential fluid containment, ensuring sustainable resource management for future generations.
                            </p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- Product Slider Section (Static Representation) -->
